Description:
Update one exact Package component through a successor Workspace

Usage:
dotnet-inspect workspace package update <component> [options]

Arguments:
<component>  Canonical packages/ID@VERSION/TFM/RID component path

Options:
--packet <packet>    Canonical Base64URL Workspace packet string
--version <version>  Exact destination Package version
--tfm <tfm>          Destination target framework (singleton context only)
--json               Emit structured JSON
--envelope           Emit the complete update envelope; requires --json
--share <share>      Emit the derived Workspace as a canonical packet or URL
--pat-for <pat-for>  Bind an ephemeral Basic credential: HTTPS-ENDPOINT USERNAME env:NAME|stdin|file:PATH
